      "local_adaptations": [
        "Retain the six Darwin patches and assign a distinct cache namespace for changed IR/constants",
        "Enforce actual locked FOZ size including wrapper bytes with mapping disabled; atomic full state",
        "Snapshot lookup candidates under lock and identify LRU entries by guest hash and footprint",
        "Start an eviction worker for read-only memory caching",
        "Fix NT directory buffer reallocation and avoid following reparse points",
        "Translate Core.cpp cache input span through GuestBase; uncorrected WoW64 failed before guest entry",
        "Preserve the serialized header when promoting disk data to the memory LRU"
      ]
    }
